25	    <title>Modern Web Template - Accessible, Responsive HTML5 Starter</title>
26	    <style>
27	        :root {
28	            --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
29	            --primary-color: #667eea;
30	            --primary-light: #8fa3f5;
